  "title": {
   "en": "Bad Secretary"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "나쁜 비서"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"You can't run away now. From this moment on, I'm going to devour you completely.\"\n\nThe night I witnessed the inappropriate relationship between my sister and my boyfriend,\nI ended up spending an impulsive one-night stand to drown my pain...\n\n\"I'm Executive Director Kang Inha.\"\n\nAnd now, I've met him again—as the boss I’ll be serving from now on.\nBut this man… doesn’t seem to remember me?\n\nTrying to stay composed despite his cool demeanor—as if one-night stands mean nothing to him—\nBut every time I see his eyes, his lips, his gestures,\nthe heat of that night keeps coming back to me.\n\n\"No wonder I get so worked up every time I see you… I’ve already fallen for you.\""
  },
